?url=%2Fimgs%2Fusers%2Favatar-6.avif&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimgs%2Fusers%2Favatar-6.avif&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimgs%2Fusers%2Favatar-6.avif&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/></div></figcaption></figure></li></ul></li></ul></div></section><div id="faqs" class=" py-24 sm:py-32 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute -top-32 left-1/4 w-72 h-72 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div><div class="absolute -bottom-32 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 relative"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-premium-soft-white sm:text-5xl">FAQs About Fake Discord Decorations</h2><div class="relative mt-4 flex justify-center"><span class="absolute -bottom-1 w-32 h-1 bg-linear-to-r from-indigo via-primary to-secondary"></span></div><p class="mt-6 text-lg/8 text-premium-light-gray">Common questions about creating fake Discord avatar decorations without Nitro.</p></div><div class="mt-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><dl class="space-y-8"><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">How can I create fake Discord decorations for free?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Use our fake Discord decoration generator — it&#x27;s free and requires no Nitro. Upload your avatar, pick a fake decoration from our collection, customize it, and download your new avatar in seconds.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Do fake Discord decorations work without Nitro?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Yes! Our fake Discord decorations don&#x27;t require Nitro. You create the decoration as part of your avatar image, then upload that image to Discord — no subscription needed.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Are fake Discord decorations as good as official ones?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Fake Discord decorations made with our tool look very similar to official ones. The difference: ours are free and baked into your avatar image, while official decorations are part of Discord&#x27;s system.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Is it allowed to use fake Discord decorations?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Absolutely. Using fake Discord decorations is fully within Discord&#x27;s rules. You&#x27;re simply uploading a custom avatar image — something Discord has always allowed.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">How do I customize fake Discord decorations?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Choose a decoration style, adjust its size and position on your avatar, then download when you&#x27;re happy with the look. Simple and takes under a minute.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Can I use fake Discord decorations for server avatars?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Yes! Fake Discord decorations work perfectly for server avatars too. Make any avatar stand out with a unique fake decoration.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">How many fake Discord decorations can I make?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Unlimited! Unlike paid Discord decorations, our tool lets you create as many fake decorations as you want — all for free.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Are fake Discord decorations high quality?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Yes. All fake decorations are high-resolution and look sharp on every Discord profile — desktop, mobile, and anywhere else.</p></div><div class="bg-linear-to-br from-card/80 to-background/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Can I change my fake Discord decorations often?</h3><p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-premium-light-gray">Of course! Come back and create a new fake Discord decoration any time you feel like switching up your look.</p></div></dl></div></div></div></main></div></div><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><!--/$--><!--$?--><template id="B:1"></template><!--/$--></main><footer class="bg-surface border-t border-border/40 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8"><div clas