models\",\"abuse\":\"Exceed usage limits or abuse system resources\"}},\"guidelines\":{\"heading\":\"Content Guidelines\",\"items\":{\"hate\":\"No hate speech, violence, or discriminatory content\",\"minors\":\"No adult content involving minors — strictly prohibited\",\"nsfw\":\"No sexually explicit, nude, or NSFW content generation is permitted under any circumstances, including paid tiers\",\"deceive\":\"No content intended to deceive or manipulate\",\"copyright\":\"Respect copyright and trademark laws\"}}},\"intellectualProperty\":{\"heading\":\"Intellectual Property\",\"yourContent\":{\"heading\":\"Your Content\",\"items\":{\"ownership\":\"You retain ownership of content you create using our Service\",\"license\":\"You grant us a license to process and store your content\",\"responsible\":\"You are responsible for ensuring your content doesn't infringe others' rights\"}},\"ourService\":{\"heading\":\"Our Service\",\"items\":{\"rights\":\"{brandName} owns all rights to the platform and AI models\",\"trademarks\":\"Our trademarks and branding are protected\",\"noCopy\":\"You may not copy, modify, or distribute our technology\"}},\"generated\":{\"heading\":\"Generated Content\",\"items\":{\"copyright\":\"AI-generated content may not be subject to copyright protection\",\"verify\":\"You are responsible for verifying the originality of generated content\",\"noWarranty\":\"We make no warranties regarding intellectual property status\"}}},\"privacy\":{\"heading\":\"Privacy and Data\",\"text\":\"Your privacy is important to us. Please review our Privacy Policy, which governs how we collect, use, and protect your information.\"},\"availability\":{\"heading\":\"Service Availability\",\"uptime\":{\"heading\":\"Uptime\",\"items\":{\"strive\":\"We strive for high availability but cannot guarantee 100% uptime\",\"maintenance\":\"Scheduled maintenance will be announced in advance\",\"interruptions\":\"Service interruptions may occur without notice\"}},\"modifications\":{\"heading\":\"Modifications\",\"items\":{\"modify\":\"We may modify or discontinue features at any time\",\"communicate\":\"Significant changes will be communicated to users\",\"acceptance\":\"Continued use constitutes acceptance of modifications\"}}},\"conduct\":{\"heading\":\"User Conduct\",\"standards\":{\"heading\":\"Community Standards\",\"items\":{\"respect\":\"Treat other users with respect\",\"report\":\"Report violations of these Terms\",\"noSpam\":\"Do not spam or abuse our support systems\"}},\"enforcement\":{\"heading\":\"Enforcement\",\"items\":{\"suspend\":\"We may suspend or terminate accounts for violations\",\"remove\":\"We reserve the right to remove content that violates these Terms\",\"ban\":\"Repeat offenders may be permanently banned\"}}},\"disclaimers\":{\"heading\":\"Disclaimers and Limitations\",\"service\":{\"heading\":\"Service Disclaimer\",\"text\":\"THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED \\\"AS IS\\\" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\"},\"liability\":{\"heading\":\"Limitation of Liability\",\"text\":\"IN NO EVENT SHALL {brandName} BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE SERVICE.\"},\"maximum\":{\"heading\":\"Maximum Liability\",\"text\":\"Our total liability to you for any claims shall not exceed the amount you paid for the Service in the 12 months preceding the claim.\"}},\"indemnification\":{\"heading\":\"Indemnification\",\"text\":\"You agree to indemnify and hold {brandName} harmless from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from:\",\"items\":{\"use\":\"Your use of the Service\",\"violation\":\"Your violation of these Terms\",\"infringement\":\"Your infringement of any third-party rights\"}},\"termination\":{\"heading\":\"Termination\",\"byYou\":{\"heading\":\"By You\",\"items\":{\"cancel\":\"Cancel your subscription at any time\",\"delete\":\"Account deletion available upon request\",\"export\":\"Data export available before termination\"}},\"byUs\":{\"heading\":\"By Us\",\"text\":\"We may terminate your account if you:\",\"items\":{\"violate\":\"Violate these Terms\",\"fraud\":\"Engage in fraudulent activity\",\"fail\":\"Fail to pay subscription fees\"}}},\"disputes\":{\"heading\":\"Dispute Resolution\",\"law\":{\"heading\":\"Governing Law\",\"text\":\"These Terms are governed by applicable law in the jurisdiction where {brandName} operates.\"},\"arbitration\":{\"heading\":\"Arbitration\",\"text\":\"Disputes shall be resolved through binding arbitration, except for intellectual property claims and small claims court matters.\"}},\"general\":{\"heading\":\"General Provisions\",\"entire\":{\"heading\":\"Entire Agreement\",\"text\":\"These Terms, along with our Privacy Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and {brandName}.\"},\"severability\":{\"heading\":\"Severability\",\"text\":\"If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall continue in effect.\"},\"updates\":{\"heading\":\"Updates\",\"text\":\"We may update these Terms periodically. Continued use constitutes acceptance of changes.\"}},\"contact\":{\"heading\":\"Contact Information\",\"text\":\"For questions about these Terms, contact us at:\",\"emailLabel\":\"Email: {email}\"},\"footer\":\"By using {brandName}, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.\"},\"myCreationsPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"My Creations\",\"description\":\"View and manage your AI-generated creations\",\"keywords\":\"My Creations, AI-generated images, AI-generated videos\"},\"title\":\"My Creations\",\"description\":\"View and manage your AI-generated creations\",\"keywords\":\"My Creations, AI-generated images, AI-generated videos\",\"tabs\":{\"video\":\"Video\",\"image\":\"Image\"},\"no_creations\":\"No creations found\",\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"please_sign_in\":\"Please Sign In\",\"sign_in_to_view_your_creations\":\"Sign in to view your AI-generated creations\",\"sign_in\":\"Sign In\",\"create_new_image\":\"Create Image\",\"create_new_video\":\"Create Video\",\"create_your_first_image\":\"Create Your First Image\",\"create_your_first_video\":\"Create Your First Video\",\"start_creating_amazing_ai_images_to_see_them_here\":\"Start creating amazing AI images to see them here\",\"start_creating_amazing_ai_videos_to_see_them_here\":\"Start creating amazing AI videos to see them here\",\"no_videos\":\"No videos found\",\"filter_by_status\":\"Filter by status\",\"generation_failed\":\"Generation Failed\",\"toast\":{\"failed_to_delete_image\":\"Failed to delete image\",\"failed_to_download_image\":\"Failed to download image\",\"failed_to_toggle_favorite\":\"Failed to toggle favorite\",\"image_downloaded_successfully\":\"Image downloaded successfully\",\"added_to_favorites\":\"Added to favorites\",\"removed_from_favorites\":\"Removed from favorites\",\"image_deleted_successfully\":\"Image deleted successfully\",\"failed_to_delete_video\":\"Failed to delete video\",\"failed_to_download_video\":\"Failed to download video\",\"video_downloaded_successfully\":\"Video downloaded successfully\",\"video_deleted_successfully\":\"Video deleted successfully\",\"failed_to_load_videos\":\"Failed to load videos\"},\"generation_mode\":{\"text-to-image\":\"Text to Image\",\"image-to-image\":\"Image to Image\",\"text-to-video\":\"Text to Video\",\"image-to-video\":\"Image to Video\"},\"status\":{\"pending\":\"Pending\",\"processing\":\"Processing\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"failed\":\"Failed\"},\"actions\":{\"detail\":\"Detail\",\"download\":\"Download\",\"favorite\":\"Favorite\",\"unfavorite\":\"Unfavorite\",\"delete\":\"Delete\"},\"delete_dialog\":{\"title\":\"Delete Creation\",\"description\":\"Are you sure you want to delete this? This action cannot be undone.\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"confirm\":\"Delete\"},\"pagination\":{\"previous\":\"Previous\",\"next\":\"Next\",\"page\":\"Page {current} of {total}\",\"showing\":\"Total results {total} results, Failed Generation will not be charged\"},\"filters\":{\"all\":\"All\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"processing\":\"Processing\",\"pending\":\"Pending\",\"failed\":\"Failed\",\"status\":\"Status\",\"mode\":\"Mode\",\"favorites_only\":\"Favorites\"}},\"AIVideoPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Hailou AI Video | Where Your Vision Becomes a Video\",\"description\":\"Hailou Video turns text or images into cinematic AI videos with audio, 4K output, and director-level control. No experience needed.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"Hailou AI Video — Create Cinematic Videos with AI\",\"description\":\"Hailou Video generates stunning videos from text or images — with physics-driven motion, native audio, and professional-grade quality. Describe your vision and watch it come to life.\"},\"feature\":{\"title\":\"AI Video That Looks and Feels Real\",\"description\":\"From physics-driven motion to synchronized audio and director-level control — Hailou Video delivers results that professional productions demand.\",\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Physics-Driven Motion Realism\",\"description\":\"Built on real-world physics simulation, Hailou Video produces smooth, stable motion across the full dynamic range — from subtle facial expressions to large-scale action scenes — with natural consistency in every frame.\",\"icon\":\"RiMovie2Line\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/feature/cat-fish.mp4\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Native Audio-Video Generation\",\"description\":\"Generate synchronized dialogue, spatial sound effects, and ambient audio alongside your video in one pass. Multiple languages and dialects are supported with accurate lip-sync and motion alignment — no post-production required.\",\"icon\":\"RiSoundModuleLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/feature/bar.mp4\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Director-Level Creative Control\",\"description\":\"Go beyond simple prompts. Precisely direct camera movement, lighting, shadows, and composition — or provide reference images, characters, and style references to guide every detail of your scene exactly as you envision it.\",\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/feature/veo_camera-controls_zoom-in.mp4\"},{\"id\":4,\"title\":\"Multi-Shot Narrative Storytelling\",\"description\":\"Create cohesive multi-shot videos where characters, visual style, and atmosphere stay consistent across every scene transition. Hailou Video understands narrative structure — ideal for short films, ads, and social content.\",\"icon\":\"RiFilmLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/feature/piano.mp4\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Built for Creators. Create What You Want.\",\"description\":\"Style control, character consistency, scene editing — Hailou Video gives you the tools to create exactly what you imagine.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiApps2Line\",\"highlight\":\"Multi-Model\",\"title\":\"The Best Models, All in One Place\",\"description\":\"Hailou Video gives you access to top-tier video generation models — each with distinct strengths. Switch between them freely to find the perfect fit for your project.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiPaletteLine\",\"highlight\":\"Any Visual Style\",\"title\":\"From Photorealism to Illustration\",\"description\":\"Generate in photorealistic, cinematic, cyberpunk, animation, or painterly styles. Provide a reference image to match a specific look — or let the model interpret your vision directly.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiUserStarLine\",\"highlight\":\"Character Consistency\",\"title\":\"Same Character, Every Scene\",\"description\":\"Keep characters looking identical across multiple shots and scene changes. Provide a reference image and Hailou Video maintains their appearance, expressions, and style throughout.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiScissorsLine\",\"highlight\":\"Scene Editing\",\"title\":\"Extend, Edit, and Reshape Scenes\",\"description\":\"Go beyond generation. Extend clips into longer sequences, add or remove objects, expand the frame with outpainting, or use a first and last frame to create seamless transitions.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiHdLine\",\"highlight\":\"High Resolution\",\"title\":\"Production-Grade Output Quality\",\"description\":\"Render in up to 4K resolution with sharp textures, rich color, and smooth motion. Every video is ready for professional use — no upscaling or post-processing needed.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShieldCheckLine\",\"highlight\":\"Commercial License\",\"title\":\"Full Ownership, No Watermarks\",\"description\":\"Every video you create with Hailou AI Video is yours. Use it in ads, social posts, client projects, or commercial campaigns — no restrictions on paid plans.\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Create Your First Hailou Video in 3 Steps\",\"description\":\"Generating professional-quality videos with Hailou AI Video is fast and straightforward — no technical skills required.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Enter a Prompt or Upload an Image\",\"description\":\"Describe the scene you want in text, or upload a photo to animate. Choose text-to-video or image-to-video mode to match your workflow.\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Your Model \u0026 Settings\",\"description\":\"Pick a model based on your creative goal — whether you need cinematic realism, stylized visuals, native audio, or multi-shot storytelling. Set your preferred aspect ratio, resolution, and video duration.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate, Preview \u0026 Download\",\"description\":\"Click generate and your Hailou Video is ready in minutes. Preview the result, adjust if needed, and download in full quality.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"Who Uses Hailou Video\",\"description\":\"From casual creators to busy teams, Hailou AI Video helps anyone produce high-quality video content — fast and without a steep learning curve.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUser3Line\",\"title\":\"For You — Anyone Can Create\",\"description\":\"Turn your photos into animated memories, make fun clips from travel shots, or bring a creative idea to life. Hailou Video needs no experience — just your imagination.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTiktokLine\",\"title\":\"Content Creators \u0026 Influencers\",\"description\":\"Produce scroll-stopping videos for TikTok, YouTube Shorts, and Instagram Reels. Generate fresh content daily with Hailou AI Video — no camera or editing software needed.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMegaphoneLine\",\"title\":\"Marketing \u0026 Social Media Teams\",\"description\":\"Create ad creatives, product demos, and campaign videos at speed. Hailou Video cuts production time so your team can test more ideas and publish faster.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShoppingBag3Line\",\"title\":\"Online Sellers \u0026 E-Commerce\",\"description\":\"Turn product photos into polished showcase videos for your store, ads, and landing pages. Hailou AI Video makes every product look its best — without a studio.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGraduationCapLine\",\"title\":\"Educators \u0026 Course Creators\",\"description\":\"Animate diagrams, build explainer clips, or produce lesson intros that grab attention. Hailou Video helps educators make content that students actually want to watch.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiStoreLine\",\"title\":\"Small Business Owners\",\"description\":\"Promote your services, showcase your work, and build brand credibility with professional-looking videos. Hailou AI Video gives small businesses big-agency quality at a fraction of the cost.\"}]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"What is Hailou AI Video?\",\"description\":\"Hailou AI Video is an online AI video generator that turns text descriptions or images into high-quality video clips. Beyond Hailou's own models, it also integrates leading third-party video generation models — so you always have access to the best available technology, no editing skills required.\"},{\"title\":\"What AI models are available in Hailou Video?\",\"description\":\"Hailou Video includes top-tier models such as Veo 3, Veo 3.1, Sora 2, Kling 3.0, Kling 2.6, Wan 2.6, Seedance V1 Pro, and more. New models are added regularly so you always have access to the latest AI video technology.\"},{\"title\":\"What is the difference between text-to-video and image-to-video?\",\"description\":\"Text-to-video generates a video clip from a written description. Image-to-video animates an existing photo or illustration, adding natural motion while preserving the original composition. Hailou Video supports both modes seamlessly.\"},{\"title\":\"Does Hailou Video generate audio too?\",\"description\":\"Yes, select models include native audio generation — producing synchronized ambient sound, music, and effects alongside the video. No separate audio tools or editing needed.\"},{\"title\":\"What resolution and aspect ratios does Hailou AI Video support?\",\"description\":\"Hailou Video supports multiple resolutions up to 4K and aspect ratios including 16:9 for landscape, 9:16 for vertical, and 1:1 for square — so your content is optimized for any platform.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I use Hailou Video content for commercial purposes?\",\"description\":\"Yes. Videos generated with Hailou AI Video can be used for commercial projects including advertisements, social media campaigns, client presentations, and e-commerce — with no watermarks on paid plans.\"},{\"title\":\"How long does it take to generate a video?\",\"description\":\"Most Hailou Video generations are ready in 2–5 minutes depending on the selected model and output length. Some fast models deliver results even sooner, making it easy to iterate and refine quickly.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Start Creating with Hailou AI Video Today\",\"description\":\"Generate stunning videos from text or images in minutes. No experience needed — just describe your idea and let Hailou Video bring it to life.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Start Creating with Hailou Video\",\"url\":\"#video-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\"}]}},\"freeImageGeneratorPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Hailou AI Free Image Generator\",\"description\":\"Generate stunning images for free with Hailou AI. Photorealistic photos, art, and illustrations from text prompts — no sign-up required.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"Hailou AI Free Image Generator\",\"description\":\"Turn your words into beautiful images in seconds. Photorealistic photos, digital art, illustrations — generated free with state-of-the-art AI. No experience needed.\"},\"gallery\":{\"badge\":\"AI-Generated Gallery\",\"title\":\"What You Can Create\",\"description\":\"Every image below was generated entirely by AI from a text prompt. See the range of styles, subjects, and moods you can bring to life.\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-1.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated portrait of a woman with cinematic golden hour lighting\",\"prompt\":\"Portrait of a young woman with dramatic cinematic lighting, golden hour warm tones, soft bokeh background, high-detail face, professional photography, photorealistic\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated magical enchanted forest with glowing mushrooms\",\"prompt\":\"Magical enchanted forest at twilight, glowing bioluminescent mushrooms and fireflies, ancient mossy trees with twisted roots, ethereal purple and teal mist, fantasy atmosphere\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-3.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated mountain peaks with aurora borealis\",\"prompt\":\"Majestic snowy mountain peaks above clouds, vivid aurora borealis green and violet curtains dancing in the night sky, crystal clear star-filled sky, breathtaking landscape photography\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-4.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated cyberpunk city skyline at night\",\"prompt\":\"Futuristic neon-lit cyberpunk city skyline at night, towering skyscrapers with glowing blue and pink neon signs, flying vehicles, rain-slicked streets reflecting colorful lights\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-5.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated golden retriever in a field of sunflowers\",\"prompt\":\"A happy golden retriever running through a vibrant field of sunflowers, warm sunny afternoon, shallow depth of field, joyful and playful mood, professional pet photography\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-6.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated underwater coral reef with tropical fish\",\"prompt\":\"Vibrant underwater coral reef scene, colorful tropical fish swimming among coral formations, clear turquoise water with sunrays filtering down, rich marine biodiversity\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-7.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated macro photo of cherry blossom with water droplets\",\"prompt\":\"Extreme macro photography of a vibrant pink cherry blossom flower, crystal water droplets on delicate petals, soft bokeh background in pastel tones, ultra-sharp detail, natural morning light\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-8.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated medieval castle on a cliff at sunset\",\"prompt\":\"Ancient medieval stone castle perched on dramatic cliff edge at sunset, warm orange and crimson sky, waves crashing below, moody atmospheric lighting, epic fantasy landscape\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-9.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated Japanese sushi platter, professional food photography\",\"prompt\":\"Artful Japanese sushi platter on dark slate board, premium nigiri and maki rolls with fresh ingredients, garnished with wasabi and ginger, professional food photography with dramatic side lighting\"},{\"src\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/gallery-10.jpg\",\"alt\":\"AI-generated deep space nebula with swirling cosmic clouds\",\"prompt\":\"Stunning deep space nebula with swirling cosmic clouds of purple, blue, and gold, bright star clusters scattered throughout, dramatic interstellar gas formations, NASA-style astrophotography\"}]},\"feature\":{\"title\":\"What Made Hailou AI Free Image Generator Stand Out\",\"description\":\"Built on one of the most advanced image generation models available today — delivering quality, speed, and creative fre