ailed composition — the model captures nuance that simpler tools miss.\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/free-image-generator/feature-creative.jpg\",\"features\":[\"Handles complex multi-element scene descriptions\",\"Captures mood, atmosphere, and artistic intent\",\"Strong prompt adherence for precise creative control\"]}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Generate Your First Free Image in 3 Steps\",\"description\":\"Creating AI-generated images with Hailou is fast, intuitive, and completely free to start. No account required for your first generations.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Write Your Prompt\",\"description\":\"Describe the image you want in plain language. Be as specific or as open-ended as you like — mention the subject, style, mood, colors, or setting.\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Size\",\"description\":\"Select the aspect ratio that fits your use case — square, landscape, or portrait. Optionally adjust the output format.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate \u0026 Download\",\"description\":\"Click Generate and your image is ready within seconds. Download it in full quality, or refine your prompt to explore different creative directions.\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Why Creators Choose Hailou AI Free Image Generator\",\"description\":\"Powerful capabilities, zero complexity — everything you need to generate great images without learning a new tool.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiSparklingLine\",\"title\":\"State-of-the-Art AI Model\",\"description\":\"Powered by an advanced 6-billion-parameter model that ranks among the best open-source generators available — delivering quality that matches or beats many paid services.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTimeLine\",\"title\":\"Generate Images in Seconds\",\"description\":\"Hailou AI uses an ultra-optimized generation pipeline that produces high-quality images incredibly fast. No long waits, no frustrating queues — just instant results.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiPaletteLine\",\"title\":\"Any Style You Can Imagine\",\"description\":\"From photorealistic portraits to surreal digital art, from oil paintings to sci-fi concept art — Hailou AI handles every visual genre with equal skill.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGlobalLine\",\"title\":\"Understands What You Mean, Not Just What You Type\",\"description\":\"Hailou AI grasps real-world knowledge and nuance in your prompts — describe a concept, a feeling, or a reference, and it knows what you mean.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiUserLine\",\"title\":\"No Technical Skills Required\",\"description\":\"Just describe what you want in everyday language. Hailou AI handles the complexity — no prompting guides, no parameter tuning, no learning curve.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShieldCheckLine\",\"title\":\"Your Images, Your Rights\",\"description\":\"Every image you generate belongs to you. Use them freely for personal projects, social media, creative work, or commercial purposes with no watermarks on paid plans.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"Who Uses Hailou AI Free Image Generator\",\"description\":\"From everyday social posts to professional creative work — Hailou AI image generation fits every use case.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUser3Line\",\"title\":\"Personal \u0026 Everyday Use\",\"description\":\"Create custom wallpapers, profile pictures, greeting cards, or gifts. Turn a simple idea into a unique image you won't find anywhere else.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTiktokLine\",\"title\":\"Content Creators \u0026 Social Media\",\"description\":\"Produce eye-catching thumbnails, cover images, and post visuals that stand out in crowded feeds — without hiring a designer or photographer.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMegaphoneLine\",\"title\":\"Marketing \u0026 Advertising\",\"description\":\"Generate on-brand product visuals, ad creatives, banner images, and campaign assets at speed. Test more concepts and iterate faster than traditional design workflows allow.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiBrushLine\",\"title\":\"Designers \u0026 Illustrators\",\"description\":\"Use Hailou AI to rapidly prototype concepts, explore visual directions, or generate reference images. Speed up your creative process without replacing your craft.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGraduationCapLine\",\"title\":\"Educators \u0026 Students\",\"description\":\"Create custom illustrations for presentations, lesson materials, study guides, and projects. Generate exactly the visual you need without searching through stock photo libraries.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiStoreLine\",\"title\":\"Small Businesses \u0026 Entrepreneurs\",\"description\":\"Build a professional visual identity without a large budget. Generate product imagery, website graphics, and promotional materials that look polished and on-brand.\"}]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Everything you need to know about Hailou AI's free image generator.\",\"label\":\"FAQ\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Is the Hailou AI image generator really free?\",\"description\":\"Yes — you can start generating images for free without creating an account. Free users receive a set of daily credits. For higher usage, faster generation, or larger outputs, paid plans are available.\"},{\"title\":\"How do I write a good prompt?\",\"description\":\"Describe your subject clearly and add details about style, mood, lighting, and composition. For example: 'A misty forest at dawn, warm golden light filtering through tall pine trees, photorealistic.' The more specific you are, the closer the result will match your vision — but simple prompts work great too.\"},{\"title\":\"What image sizes and aspect ratios are supported?\",\"description\":\"Hailou AI supports a range of aspect ratios including 1:1 square, 16:9 landscape, 9:16 portrait, and more. You can also select the output resolution depending on your plan — higher resolutions produce sharper, more detailed images.\"},{\"title\":\"How long does it take to generate an image?\",\"description\":\"Most images are ready within a few seconds. Hailou AI uses an optimized generation engine designed for speed without sacrificing quality.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I use the generated images commercially?\",\"description\":\"Yes. Images generated with Hailou AI come without watermarks and can be used for commercial purposes including advertising, products, and client work. Free-tier images are best suited for personal and non-commercial use.\"},{\"title\":\"Does Hailou AI support non-English prompts?\",\"description\":\"Yes — Hailou AI understands prompts in many languages. That said, English prompts tend to produce the most accurate and detailed results.\"},{\"title\":\"What makes different from other free image generators?\",\"description\":\"Hailou AI is powered by a next-generation model that delivers results significantly better than older diffusion-based generators. It produces more photorealistic output, handles complex prompts more accurately, and generates images far faster — all from a simple, clean interface.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Start Generating Free AI Images Now\",\"description\":\"No sign-up required. Describe your idea and see it come to life in seconds with Hailou AI's free image generator.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Generate Free Images\",\"url\":\"#image-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\"}]}},\"componentExamplePage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Hailou AI – All In One AI Image, Video \u0026 Music Generator\",\"description\":\"Hailou AI turns text and images into stunning videos, visuals, and songs in minutes. One creative workspace for all your AI projects.\"},\"simPleusage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Generate AI Images in 3 Easy Steps\",\"description\":\"Create stunning AI-generated images in seconds — no design skills required.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Describe Your Image\",\"description\":\"Type a prompt describing the image you want. Be as specific or as creative as you like — style, mood, subject, and colors all help the AI understand your vision.\"},{\"title\":\"Choose a Model \u0026 Style\",\"description\":\"Select from a range of AI models optimized for different styles — photorealism, illustration, anime, and more. Adjust aspect ratio and quality to match your needs.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate \u0026 Download\",\"description\":\"Hit generate and your image is ready in seconds. Preview the result, regenerate with tweaks if needed, and download in full resolution.\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"Detailed Guide\",\"title\":\"Everything You Can Do with Hailou AI Image\",\"description\":\"From a simple prompt to a polished final image — here's how the full workflow looks.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Write Your Prompt\",\"description\":\"Start with a clear description of the image you have in mind.\",\"substeps\":[{\"title\":\"Use natural language\",\"description\":\"Describe the scene as you would to a friend — no special syntax needed.\"},{\"title\":\"Add style keywords\",\"description\":\"Include words like \\\"cinematic\\\", \\\"watercolor\\\", or \\\"8k photo\\\" to steer the aesthetic.\"},{\"title\":\"Try negative prompts\",\"description\":\"Specify what to exclude (e.g. \\\"no text, no watermark\\\") to refine the output.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Configure Generation Settings\",\"description\":\"Fine-tune the model and output options before generating.\",\"substeps\":[{\"title\":\"Select an AI model\",\"description\":\"Pick from Flux, SDXL, or other models based on your style preference.\"},{\"title\":\"Set aspect ratio\",\"description\":\"Choose landscape, portrait, or square depending on where you'll use the image.\"},{\"title\":\"Adjust quality \u0026 steps\",\"description\":\"Higher step counts produce more refined results at the cost of generation time.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Review, Refine \u0026 Export\",\"description\":\"Evaluate your results and get the final image ready for use.\",\"substeps\":[{\"title\":\"Compare variations\",\"description\":\"Generate multiple versions and compare them side by side.\"},{\"title\":\"Upscale for print\",\"description\":\"Use AI upscaling to enhance resolution before downloading.\"},{\"title\":\"Save to My Creations\",\"description\":\"All generated images are saved to your account for easy access later.\"}]}]}},\"indexPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Free Discord Avatar Decorations - Customize Your PFP with Ease\",\"description\":\"Get free Discord avatar decorations without Nitro. Customize your PFP with cool effects and download instantly. 100% free.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Free Discord Avatar Decorations\",\"p\":\"Tired of expensive discord avatar decorations? Create stunning Discord avatar decorations for free. Want AI-powered custom avatars? Try our AI Avatar Generator and AI Avatar Decoration tools.\"},\"feature\":{\"title\":\"Why Choose Our Free Discord Avatar Decoration Maker?\",\"description\":\"Create cool Discord avatar decorations for free — no expensive tools needed. Customize your PFP in minutes with our easy-to-use generator.\",\"features\":[{\"name\":\"100% Free, No Nitro\",\"description\":\"All Discord avatar decorations are completely free to use and download. No Nitro subscription, no paid tier — just pick your decoration and go.\",\"icon\":\"GiftIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Easy to Use\",\"description\":\"Our free Discord decoration maker is simple and user-friendly. No design skills or software needed. Just pick, customize, and download!\",\"icon\":\"SparklesIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Hundreds of Designs\",\"description\":\"Browse a wide collection of Discord avatar decorations and effects. Find the perfect style to make your Discord PFP stand out in any server.\",\"icon\":\"AdjustmentsHorizontalIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Ready in Seconds\",\"description\":\"Get your Discord avatar decoration in seconds. Fast and efficient — your new PFP is ready to upload to Discord right away.\",\"icon\":\"ClockIcon\"},{\"name\":\"High-Quality Output\",\"description\":\"Download high-quality Discord avatar decorations that look sharp and professional on your profile. Perfect for PFPs on any device or screen size.\",\"icon\":\"StarIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Works on Any Account\",\"description\":\"Ou