{\"title\":\"Download and Upload to Discord\",\"description\":\"Happy with the result? Download your free Discord avatar decoration and upload it to Discord. Your new PFP is ready to show off!\"}]}},\"gifExtractorPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Free GIF Frame Extractor Tool - Extract Frames Fast\",\"description\":\"Extract individual frames from any GIF file online for free. No signup required, instant download.\"}},\"howToGetFreePage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"How to Get Free Discord Avatar Decorations in 2025\",\"description\":\"Learn how to get free Discord avatar decorations without Nitro. Step-by-step guide for all users.\"}},\"fakeDiscordDecorationPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Fake Discord Decorations - Create Cool Avatar Effects\",\"description\":\"Create fake Discord decorations for free — no Nitro needed. Design fake avatar effects that look like premium decorations. 100% free.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Create Fake Discord Decorations for Free\",\"p\":\"Want fake Discord decorations that look just like the real thing — but cost nothing? Design fake Discord avatar effects in seconds. No Nitro, no payment, no account required. Start creating your fake decoration today!\"},\"feature\":{\"title\":\"Why Use Our Fake Discord Decoration Tool?\",\"description\":\"Create fake Discord decorations that look professional and cost nothing. Fast, free, and no Nitro required.\",\"features\":[{\"name\":\"100% Free, Unlimited\",\"description\":\"Create as many fake Discord decorations as you want — completely free. No Discord Shop purchases, no Nitro, no limits.\",\"icon\":\"GiftIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Looks Like the Real Thing\",\"description\":\"Our fake Discord decorations are designed to look just like official avatar decorations. Your friends won't be able to tell the difference.\",\"icon\":\"SparklesIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Wide Range of Fake Styles\",\"description\":\"Browse a huge selection of fake Discord decoration styles — crowns, halos, frames, glowing effects and more. All free, all yours.\",\"icon\":\"AdjustmentsHorizontalIcon\"},{\"name\":\"Done in Seconds\",\"description\":\"Pick a fake Discord decoration, apply it to your avatar, and download in seconds. No complicated steps, no waiting.\",\"icon\":\"ClockIcon\"},{\"name\":\"High-Quality Fake Decorations\",\"description\":\"Every fake Discord decoration is high-resolution and looks sharp on any Discord profile. Your avatar will look polished and professional.\",\"icon\":\"StarIcon\"},{\"name\":\"No Nitro Required\",\"description\":\"Official Discord decorations need Nitro. Our fake Discord decorations don't. Get the same premium look without paying anything.\",\"icon\":\"ShieldCheckIcon\"}]},\"testimonial\":{\"title\":\"What Users Say About Our Fake Discord Decorations\",\"description\":\"Thousands of Discord users are using our fake decoration maker to create unique avatars. See what they have to say!\",\"testimonials\":[[{\"content\":\"This fake Discord decoration tool is a game-changer! I made an awesome avatar in no time, and it looks just as good as the paid ones.\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Sheryl Berge\",\"role\":\"Discord Enthusiast\",\"image\":\"/imgs/users/avatar-1.png\"}},{\"content\":\"The fake Discord decorations look so realistic! My friends thought I bought them from the Discord Shop, but they were completely free!\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"James Carter\",\"role\":\"Streamer\",\"image\":\"/imgs/users/avatar-2.png\"}}],[{\"content\":\"I love how easy it was to create fake Discord decorations. My avatar looks amazing, and I didn't spend a penny!\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Emily Wong\",\"role\":\"Student\",\"image\":\"/imgs/users/avatar-3.png\"}},{\"content\":\"Why pay for official decorations when you can make fake ones for free? This tool saved me money and made my profile stand out!\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Michael Lee\",\"role\":\"Server Admin\",\"image\":\"/imgs/users/avatar-4.png\"}}],[{\"content\":\"Creating fake Discord decorations was so fun and easy! My avatar now has a unique look that everyone loves.\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Sophia Brown\",\"role\":\"Casual Gamer\",\"image\":\"/imgs/users/avatar-5.png\"}},{\"content\":\"I can make fake Discord decorations that look exactly like the real ones — without spending a single dollar. Amazing tool!\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Daniel Kim\",\"role\":\"Tech Lover\",\"image\":\"/imgs/users/avatar-6.avif\"}}]]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"FAQs About Fake Discord Decorations\",\"description\":\"Common questions about creating fake Discord avatar decorations without Nitro.\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"How can I create fake Discord decorations for free?\",\"answer\":\"Use our fake Discord decoration generator — it's free and requires no Nitro. Upload your avatar, pick a fake decoration from our collection, customize it, and download your new avatar in seconds.\"},{\"question\":\"Do fake Discord decorations work without Nitro?\",\"answer\":\"Yes! Our fake Discord decorations don't require Nitro. You create the decoration as part of your avatar image, then upload that image to Discord — no subscription needed.\"},{\"question\":\"Are fake Discord decorations as good as official ones?\",\"answer\":\"Fake Discord decorations made with our tool look very similar to official ones. The difference: ours are free and baked into your avatar image, while official decorations are part of Discord's system.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it allowed to use fake Discord decorations?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely. Using fake Discord decorations is fully within Discord's rules. You're simply uploading a custom avatar image — something Discord has always allowed.\"},{\"question\":\"How do I customize fake Discord decorations?\",\"answer\":\"Choose a decoration style, adjust its size and position on your avatar, then download when you're happy with the look. Simple and takes under a minute.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I use fake Discord decorations for server avatars?\",\"answer\":\"Yes! Fake Discord decorations work perfectly for server avatars too. Make any avatar stand out with a unique fake decoration.\"},{\"question\":\"How many fake Discord decorations can I make?\",\"answer\":\"Unlimited! Unlike paid Discord decorations, our tool lets you create as many fake decorations as you want — all for free.\"},{\"question\":\"Are fake Discord decorations high quality?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. All fake decorations are high-resolution and look sharp on every Discord profile — desktop, mobile, and anywhere else.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I change my fake Discord decorations often?\",\"answer\":\"Of course! Come back and create a new fake Discord decoration any time you feel like switching up your look.\"}]},\"howItWorks\":{\"title\":\"How to Create Fake Discord Decorations\",\"description\":\"Create fake Discord decorations in 4 simple steps — no Nitro, no design skills, completely free.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Upload Your Avatar\",\"description\":\"Upload your current Discord profile picture or choose one of our templates. This is the base for your fake Discord decoration.\"},{\"title\":\"Pick a Fake Discord Decoration\",\"description\":\"Browse our collection of fake Discord decorations. Choose any style — crowns, halos, frames, effects — all free.\"},{\"title\":\"Customize the Fake Decoration\",\"description\":\"Adjust the fake decoration's size and position to fit your avatar perfectly. Tweak until it looks just right.\"},{\"title\":\"Download and Upload to Discord\",\"description\":\"Download your avatar with the fake Discord decoration applied, then upload it to Discord. Done — enjoy your new look!\"}]}},\"aiAvatarPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"AI Avatar Generator - Create Stunning AI Avatars\",\"description\":\"Generate AI avatars in any style — anime, realistic, fantasy \u0026 cyberpunk. Transform photos or create from prompts instantly.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"AI Avatar Generator — Create Any Style Avatar Instantly\",\"description\":\"Transform a photo or start from scratch — generate anime portraits, photorealistic avatars, cyberpunk characters, and more using advanced AI image generation. Consistent likeness, stunning quality, seconds to create.\"},\"gallery\":{\"title\":\"Every Style, One Generator\",\"description\":\"From anime to photorealistic — see what our AI avatar generator can create. Each example below was generated using AI from a text prompt or a reference photo.\",\"features\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"icon\":\"RiStarSmileLine\",\"title\":\"Anime Style Avatar\",\"description\":\"Anime-style portraits capture the iconic look of Japanese animation — expressive eyes, soft cel-shading, and clean linework. Perfect for Discord profiles, gaming characters, and social media avatars with a bold, stylized personality.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Anime-style portrait of a young woman, large expressive eyes, pastel hair with light pink highlights, soft cel-shading, clean line art, detailed face, kawaii aesthetic, studio lighting\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar/gallery-anime.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"2\",\"icon\":\"RiCameraLensLine\",\"title\":\"Realistic Style Avatar\",\"description\":\"Photorealistic avatars achieve the quality of professional portrait photography. Cinematic lighting, natural skin textures, and sharp detail make these ideal for LinkedIn profiles, professional bios, and personal branding — generated from your own photo.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Transform into a professional photorealistic fashion editorial portrait, natural skin texture, cinematic studio lighting, soft bokeh background, high-detail face, keep the same person\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar/gallery-realistic.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"3\",\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"title\":\"Fantasy Style Avatar\",\"description\":\"Fantasy avatars transport characters into worlds of epic myth and magic. Ornate armor, glowing runes, and dramatic lighting create stunning hero portraits — ideal for tabletop RPG campaigns, game profiles, and fantasy storytelling projects.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Fantasy portrait of a young woman warrior, ornate golden armor with intricate engravings, glowing magical runes floating around her, ethereal purple and gold background with magical particles, dramatic epic lighting, digital art, highly detailed\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar/gallery-fantasy.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"4\",\"icon\":\"RiFlashlightLine\",\"title\":\"Cyberpunk Style Avatar\",\"description\":\"Cyberpunk avatars blend human portraiture with futuristic technology — neon highlights, AR visors, glowing circuit tattoos, and rain-soaked urban backdrops. A perfect fit for tech communities, gaming channels, and anyone who lives on the digital edge. Generated from a reference photo.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Transform into a cyberpunk portrait with neon blue and pink color highlights on face, add a futuristic augmented reality visor, rain-slicked dark urban night background, subtle glowing circuit pattern tattoos on skin, ultra-detailed cinematic style\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar/gallery-cyberpunk.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"5\",\"icon\":\"RiEmotionHappyLine\",\"title\":\"Cartoon Style Avatar\",\"description\":\"Cartoon avatars take inspiration from Pixar-style 3D animation — bold expressive features, vibrant saturated colors, and a warm, approachable personality. Great for kids' channels, brand mascots, lighthearted social profiles, and anyone who wants an avatar full of character.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Cartoon-style 3D animated portrait avatar of a young woman, bold expressive facial features, vibrant saturated colors, clean sharp outlines, friendly approachable warm expression, Pixar-inspired 3D rendered style, soft warm studio lighting\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar/gallery-cartoon.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"6\",\"icon\":\"RiGamepadLine\",\"title\":\"Pixel Art Style Avatar\",\"description\":\"Pixel art avatars celebrate the retro aesthetic of classic video games — vivid color palettes, crisp pixel grids, and iconic RPG hero designs. These avatars carry huge nostalgic appeal and work perfectly for indie game profiles, retro gaming communities, and Twitch streamers.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Pixel art portrait avatar of a young woman hero, retro video game character style, vivid bright color palette, iconic RPG hero design with adventurer outfit, charming retro 16-bit aesthetic, clear pixel grid style\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar/gallery-pixel.jpg\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Create Your AI Avatar in 3 Simple Steps\",\"description\":\"No design skills needed. Write a prompt, adjust your settings, and generate a professional-quality avatar in seconds.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Write Your Prompt\",\"description\":\"Describe your avatar: the style (anime, realistic, cyberpunk), the mood, colors, and character details. Or upload a photo to transform your appearance into any style.\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Ratio \u0026 Resolution\",\"description\":\"Select the aspect ratio that fits your use case — 1:1 square for profile pictures, 9:16 portrait for full-body shots. Higher pixel settings deliver sharper, print-ready results.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate \u0026 Download\",\"description\":\"Click Generate and your avatar appears within seconds. Download in full quality, or refine your prompt to explore different creative directions.\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Why Creators Choose Our AI Avatar Generator\",\"description\":\"Advanced AI capabilities built for portrait and character creation — delivering consistency, quality, and creative range that sets a new standard.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUserFocusLine\",\"title\":\"Consistent Character Likeness\",\"description\":\"Our AI maintains recognizable facial features and personal traits across multiple generations. Upload a photo once and create dozens of avatar variations — all unmistakably you.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiPaletteLine\",\"title\":\"Master Every Visual Style\",\"description\":\"One generator handles every aesthetic — from photorealistic portraits to anime, fantasy, cyberpunk, cartoon, and pixel art. Switch styles without switching tools.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiImageEditLine\",\"title\":\"Photo-to-Avatar Transformation\",\"description\":\"Upload any portrait photo and transform it into any style you choose. The AI preserves your likeness while completely reimagining your aesthetic.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGalleryLine\",\"title\":\"Blend Multiple Photos\",\"description\":\"Combine multiple source images into a single cohesive output. Merge yourself with a costume reference, a background scene, or a style image for completely unique results.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiRocketLine\",\"title\":\"Results in Seconds\",\"description\":\"Advanced AI generation architecture delivers high-quality avatar images incredibly fast. No long queues, no waiting — describe your idea and see it materialize in moments.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"title\":\"Natural Language Control\",\"description\":\"Prompt in plain English. Describe the vibe, mood, colors, or character archetype you want — the AI understands nuance and translates your words into precise visual output.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"Who Uses Our AI Avatar Generator\",\"description\":\"From personal profiles to professional creative projects — AI avatar generation fits every context where visual identity matters.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUser3Line\",\"title\":\"Profile Pictures \u0026 Social Media\",\"description\":\"Stand out across platforms with a unique, eye-catching avatar that reflects your personality. Generate multiple variants to match different platforms or moods.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGamepadLine\",\"title\":\"Gaming \u0026 Virtual Identity\",\"description\":\"Create custom character portraits for gaming profiles, Discord servers, virtual worlds, and online communities. Build a consistent visual identity across every platform you play on.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiStoreLine\",\"title\":\"Brand Mascots \u0026 Identity\",\"description\":\"Design memorable character mascots for your brand, product, or content channel. AI generation makes it fast to explore dozens of character concepts before committing to a direction.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiBrushLine\",\"title\":\"Creative Projects \u0026 Illustration\",\"description\":\"Rapidly generate character concepts, reference portraits, and visual prototypes for comics, books, games, or design projects. Speed up your creative workflow without replacing your craft.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGiftLine\",\"title\":\"Personalized Gifts \u0026 Portraits\",\"description\":\"Transform photos of friends, family, or pets into stylized portrait artwork as unique, meaningful gifts. Anime, fantasy, or painterly styles make every portrait special.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiLiveLine\",\"title\":\"Content Creation \u0026 Streaming\",\"description\":\"Create professional-quality channel art, stream overlays, emotes, and character branding assets. AI generation makes consistent, on-brand visual content fast and accessible.\"}]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Everything you need to know about AI avatar generation.\",\"label\":\"FAQ\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Can I generate an avatar from my own photo?\",\"description\":\"Yes — upload a portrait photo and the AI will use it as a reference to generate avatar variations in any style you choose. The model maintains your likeness and facial features while transforming the aesthetic.\"},{\"title\":\"How do I write a good avatar prompt?\",\"description\":\"Describe the style (anime, cyberpunk, fantasy), the mood (heroic, serene, mysterious), key visual details (hair color, eye color, costume), and any artistic references. Example: 'Cyberpunk portrait, neon blue hair, silver visor, dark city background, cinematic lighting.' The more specific, the more accurate the result.\"},{\"title\":\"What styles can the AI avatar generator create?\",\"description\":\"The generator handles virtually any visual style — anime, manga, photorealistic, fantasy, sci-fi, cyberpunk, cartoon, oil painting, watercolor, pixel art, and more. Describe the style in your prompt and the AI adapts accordingly.\"},{\"title\":\"What aspect ratios are supported?\",\"description\":\"You can generate avatars in 1:1 square (ideal for profile pictures), 9:16 portrait (full-body), 16:9 landscape, and other standard ratios. Square format works best for most social platform avatar requirements.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I use AI avatars for commercial purposes?\",\"description\":\"Yes. Avatars generated on paid plans come without watermarks and can be used for commercial purposes including branding, marketing materials, products, and client work.\"},{\"title\":\"How is this different from other avatar generators?\",\"description\":\"Most avatar tools are limited to a fixed set of preset styles or templates. Our AI generator understands natural language prompts and can produce virtually any character concept, style, or aesthetic you can describe — with professional-quality results and consistent character likeness.\"},{\"title\":\"How many avatars can I generate?\",\"description\":\"The number of generations depends on your plan. Each generation consumes credits. Paid plans provide higher credit allowances, faster generation, and access to higher resolution outputs.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Create Your AI Avatar Now\",\"description\":\"Describe your ideal avatar and generate a stunning portrait in seconds. Any style, any character — all powered by AI.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Generate Your Avatar\",\"url\":\"#image-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\"}]}},\"aiAvatarDecorationPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"AI Avatar Decoration — Add Magic to Your Avatar\",\"description\":\"Upload your avatar and add crowns, halos, wings \u0026 more with AI. Transform any photo into a stunning decorated avatar instantly.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"AI Avatar Decoration — Add Stunning Decorations to Any Avatar\",\"subtitle\":\"AI-Powered Avatar Decoration\",\"description\":\"Upload your photo and let AI add magical decorations — royal crowns, glowing halos, angelic wings, floral wreaths, cyberpunk visors, and more. Perfect for Discord, social profiles, and gaming avatars.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Decorate My Avatar\",\"url\":\"#image-generator\",\"icon\":\"RiVipCrownLine\"}]},\"gallery\":{\"title\":\"Every Decoration Style, One Upload\",\"description\":\"Upload any photo and describe the decoration — our AI adds it naturally, preserving your face and expression while creating a stunning effect.\",\"features\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"icon\":\"RiVipCrownLine\",\"title\":\"Royal Crown Decoration\",\"description\":\"Transform your avatar into royalty with an ornate golden crown. The AI places the crown naturally on your head, matching the lighting and style of your original photo — no Photoshop skills needed.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Add a royal golden crown on her head, ornate jeweled details with rubies and diamonds, regal and elegant, the crown sits naturally on her hair, same facial expression and background preserved\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar-decoration/gallery-crown.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"2\",\"icon\":\"RiMoonLine\",\"title\":\"Glowing Halo Effect\",\"description\":\"Add a divine glowing halo above your head for an angelic, ethereal look. The soft golden light radiates naturally around your avatar, making it perfect for spiritual, fantasy, or simply standout profile pictures.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Add a glowing golden halo floating above her head, soft ethereal divine light emanating from it, angelic glow with warm golden light rays, same face and expression preserved\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar-decoration/gallery-halo.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"3\",\"icon\":\"RiWindyLine\",\"title\":\"Angel Wings\",\"description\":\"Unfurl magnificent white feathered angel wings behind your avatar. The wings spread gracefully with soft golden-lit edges, creating a powerful yet elegant celestial portrait — ideal for fantasy role-play or creative profiles.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Add large white feathered angel wings behind her, wings spread gracefully on both sides, soft feathered texture with golden light edges, same face and pose preserved\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar-decoration/gallery-wings.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"4\",\"icon\":\"RiLeafLine\",\"title\":\"Floral Wreath Crown\",\"description\":\"Crown your avatar with a beautiful wreath of roses, daisies, and fresh green leaves. The floral decoration blends naturally with your hair and lighting, creating a romantic, garden-fresh portrait with timeless appeal.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Add a beautiful floral crown wreath on her head with pink roses, white daisies and green leaves, natural and lifelike flowers, same face and expression preserved\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar-decoration/gallery-floral.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"5\",\"icon\":\"RiEyeLine\",\"title\":\"Cyberpunk HUD Visor\",\"description\":\"Step into the future with a sleek cyberpunk HUD visor overlaid on your avatar. Neon blue holographic displays and circuit-patterned frames add a high-tech, sci-fi edge to any profile picture — perfect for gaming and tech communities.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Add a sleek futuristic cyberpunk HUD visor over her eyes, neon blue holographic display with data readouts, subtle circuit patterns on the visor frame, same face and expression preserved\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar-decoration/gallery-cyberpunk.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"6\",\"icon\":\"RiSparklingLine\",\"title\":\"Magic Sparkle Aura\",\"description\":\"Surround your avatar with a magical aura of glowing sparkles and stars. Golden and purple particles float gracefully around your portrait, giving it a mystical, fairy-tale quality that stands out in any feed or profile.\\n\\n**Prompt used:** Surround her with magical sparkle particles and glowing stars, mystical fairy-tale aura, soft golden and purple sparkles floating around her head and shoulders, same face preserved\",\"imageUrl\":\"/imgs/ai-avatar-decoration/gallery-sparkle.jpg\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Decorate Your Avatar in 3 Simple Steps\",\"description\":\"No design software, no editing skills required. Just upload, describe, and generate.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Upload Your Photo\",\"description\":\"Upload your avatar or portrait photo. You can add up to 3 images for better character consistency — the AI will maintain your likeness while adding the decoration.\"},{\"title\":\"Describe the Decoration\",\"description\":\"Type what you want to add: a crown, halo, angel wings, floral wreath, cyberpunk visor, or any decoration you can imagine. Be as creative or as specific as you like.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate \u0026 Download\",\"description\":\"Click Generate and the AI adds your chosen decoration in seconds, naturally blended with your photo. Download the result and use it on Discord, social media, or anywhere you want.\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Why Use AI Avatar Decoration?\",\"description\":\"Our AI decoration tool goes beyond simple filters — it understands context, lighting, and style to add decorations that look naturally integrated with your photo.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUserLine\",\"title\":\"Face Preserved\",\"description\":\"Your facial features, expression, and likeness are fully preserved. The AI adds decorations around and on top of you — not instead of you.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiPaletteLine\",\"title\":\"Endless Decoration Styles\",\"description\":\"From royal crowns and halos to cyberpunk visors, floral wreaths, angel wings, magic sparkles, and more — the decoration possibilities are limitless.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"title\":\"Natural Integration\",\"description\":\"Decorations blend naturally with your photo's lighting, shadows, and color tone. No obvious Photoshop seams — just a seamless, professional result.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGalleryLine\",\"title\":\"Multi-Photo Fusion\",\"description\":\"Upload up to 3 photos of yourself to help the AI build a stronger likeness. The model combines them for the most accurate and consistent decoration result.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiRocketLine\",\"title\":\"Instant Results\",\"description\":\"Most decorations are generated in under 30 seconds. No waiting, no queues — get your decorated avatar ready to use immediately.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiUser3Line\",\"title\":\"Discord \u0026 Social Ready\",\"description\":\"Output formats and aspect ratios are optimized for Discord avatars, Twitter/X, Instagram, and gaming profiles. Download and upload directly.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"Perfect for Every Occasion\",\"description\":\"Whether you want to stand out on Discord, level up your gaming profile, or create a unique persona — AI avatar decoration gives your profile picture the edge it needs.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUser3Line\",\"title\":\"Discord Avatar Decorations\",\"description\":\"Create eye-catching Discord avatars with halos, crowns, and sparkles that reflect your server role or personal style.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGamepadLine\",\"title\":\"Gaming Profile Avatars\",\"description\":\"Level up your gaming identity with epic decorations — warrior crowns, cyberpunk visors, and magical auras that match your in-game persona.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiHeartLine\",\"title\":\"Social Media Profile Pictures\",\"description\":\"Make your Instagram, Twitter, or TikTok profile picture unforgettable with beautiful floral wreaths, glowing halos, or angelic wings.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiLiveLine\",\"title\":\"Content Creator Branding\",\"description\":\"Build a recognizable, branded look for your channel or stream with unique avatar decorations that reflect your creative identity.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGiftLine\",\"title\":\"Special Occasion Portraits\",\"description\":\"Celebrate birthdays, holidays, anniversaries, or achievements with a specially decorated portrait — a unique digital keepsake.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"title\":\"Fantasy \u0026 Role-Play Characters\",\"description\":\"Bring your RPG characters, fantasy personas, or cosplay identities to life with decorations tailored to their world and story.\"}]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Everything you need to know about AI avatar decoration.\",\"label\":\"FAQ\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"What is AI avatar decoration?\",\"description\":\"AI avatar decoration is the process of using an AI image editing model to add decorative elements — such as crowns, halos, wings, floral wreaths, or cyberpunk accessories — to an existing portrait photo. The AI understands the photo's lighting, depth, and style to place the decoration naturally.\"},{\"title\":\"Which types of decorations can I add?\",\"description\":\"You can add virtually any decoration by describing it in the prompt. Popular examples include royal crowns, golden halos, angel wings, floral wreaths, magical sparkle auras, cyberpunk visors, laurel wreaths, devil horns, star crowns, and glowing accessories. If you can describe it, the AI can attempt to create it.\"},{\"title\":\"Do I need to upload a photo to use this tool?\",\"description\":\"Yes — this tool is designed for image-to-image editing. You upload your avatar or portrait photo, describe the decoration you want, and the AI adds it to your image. The tool supports up to 3 input photos for better character consistency.\"},{\"title\":\"Will my face and likeness be preserved?\",\"description\":\"Yes. The AI is specifically designed to maintain character consistency — your facial features, skin tone, expression, and background are preserved while the decoration is added naturally on top of or around you.\"},{\"title\":\"What output formats and aspect ratios are supported?\",\"description\":\"You can download decorated avatars in JPG or PNG format. Supported aspect ratios include Auto (matches your input), 1:1 (square, ideal for most profile pictures), 4:5 (portrait), and 9:16 (vertical). For Discord avatars, 1:1 square is recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I use the decorated avatars on Discord or social media?\",\"description\":\"Yes. The images generated are yours to use however you like, including as Discord profile pictures, social media avatars, gaming profile images, or personal use. Please review the platform's own terms regarding profile picture content.\"},{\"title\":\"How does the AI add decorations so naturally?\",\"description\":\"The underlying AI model is powered by Google's Gemini image generation technology. It uses deep understanding of visual context — lighting direction, depth, color temperature, and style — to place decorations that look like they belong in the original photo rather than being pasted on top.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Start Decorating Your Avatar Now\",\"description\":\"Upload your photo, describe your decoration, and get a stunning result in seconds. No design skills needed.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Decorate My Avatar\",\"url\":\"#image-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\",\"variant\":\"default\",\"icon\":\"RiVipCrownLine\"}]}},\"AIKissGeneratorPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"AI Kiss Video Generator - Make Kissing Videos from Photos\",\"description\":\"Turn any photo into an animated kissing video. Upload one photo with two people, or two separate portraits. Fun, fast, shareable.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"AI Kiss Video Generator — Turn Photos Into Kissing Videos\",\"description\":\"Upload one photo with two people in it, or two separate portraits — our AI kiss video generator animates them into a fun, shareable kissing clip in minutes. Works with people, pets, and characters.\"},\"demo\":{\"title\":\"See the AI Kiss Generator in Action\",\"description\":\"Upload two portraits and watch the AI compose and animate them into a kissing video — no prompts, no editing needed.\",\"inputLabel\":\"Input Photos\",\"outputLabel\":\"AI Generated Kiss Video\",\"examples\":[{\"inputImages\":[\"/videos/ai-kiss/kiss-man.jpeg\",\"/videos/ai-kiss/swift.jpg\"],\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/ai-kiss/swift-kiss.mp4\"},{\"inputImages\":[\"/videos/ai-kiss/kiss-man.jpeg\",\"/videos/ai-kiss/kiss-women.jpeg\"],\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/ai-kiss/wave-kiss.mp4\"}]},\"feature\":{\"title\":\"AI Kiss Video Generator in Action\",\"description\":\"See how our AI kiss video generator turns real photos into animated kissing videos. Two input modes, one great result.\",\"features\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"title\":\"Fluid Kiss Animation\",\"description\":\"The AI generates smooth, frame-by-frame motion that feels expressive and convincing. Facial features, proportions, and likeness are preserved throughout the full 5-second kissing video.\",\"icon\":\"RiHeartLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/ai-kiss/ai-kiss-demo.mp4\"},{\"id\":\"2\",\"title\":\"French Kiss Style\",\"description\":\"The AI kiss video generator supports more expressive animation styles for bolder, more dramatic results. Great for social media content, meme creation, or memorable clips for special occasions.\",\"icon\":\"RiMovie2Line\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/ai-kiss/french-kiss.mp4\"},{\"id\":\"3\",\"title\":\"Enhanced Output Quality\",\"description\":\"Get a sharper, more detailed kissing video with enhanced post-processing. Fine facial details are preserved and motion is crisper — ready to share on any platform without further editing.\",\"icon\":\"RiHdLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/ai-kiss/kiss-demo-enhance.mp4\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Why Use Our AI Kiss Video Generator\",\"description\":\"Flexible input, zero setup, and results worth sharing — here's what makes this AI kiss video generator different.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiImage2Line\",\"title\":\"Two Flexible Input Modes\",\"description\":\"Upload one photo with two people already in the same frame, or provide two separate photos with one person each. The AI kiss video generator handles both — no pre-cropping required.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiPawLine\",\"title\":\"People, Pets, Characters\",\"description\":\"Any recognizable face works — people, dogs, cats, cartoon characters. If it has a face, the AI can animate it into a kissing video.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiFlashlightLine\",\"title\":\"Zero Prompts or Settings\",\"description\":\"No text prompts, no style pickers, no complex configuration. Just upload your photo or photos and hit generate — the AI does everything else.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShareLine\",\"title\":\"Built for Social Media\",\"description\":\"The output is a short, punchy clip perfectly sized for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and Stories. Download and share straight from the browser.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTimeLine\",\"title\":\"Consistent 5-Second Output\",\"description\":\"Every ai kiss video is exactly 5 seconds — the ideal length for social content and reaction clips. No trimming needed, just download and go.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShieldCheckLine\",\"title\":\"Likeness Preserved\",\"description\":\"The AI keeps both subjects recognizable throughout the animation. Faces, proportions, and overall appearance stay true to the original photos from start to finish.\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Create an AI Kiss Video in 3 Steps\",\"description\":\"Two input options, one simple workflow. Pick the mode that fits your photo and generate in minutes.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Upload Your Photo or Photos\",\"description\":\"Have a single photo with two people? Upload it in the left slot and leave the right empty. Have two separate portraits? Upload one person per slot. Both modes work with the same AI kiss video generator.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate the Kissing Video\",\"description\":\"Click generate. The AI composes the faces, plans the animation, and renders your kissing video. Processing typically takes a few minutes — you will be notified when it is ready.\"},{\"title\":\"Download and Share\",\"description\":\"Your 5-second AI kiss video is ready to download. Share it on TikTok, Instagram, or send it directly in a message — no extra editing required.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"What People Create with AI Kiss Video Generator\",\"description\":\"From relationship milestones to pet content and viral memes — here's how people use this AI kiss video generator.\",\"items\":[{\"ic