generate an AI kiss video?\",\"description\":\"Each AI kiss video typically takes a few minutes to generate. The model needs time to compose the faces, plan the motion, and render the final clip. You will be notified once it is ready.\"},{\"title\":\"What photos work best with the AI kiss video generator?\",\"description\":\"Clear, well-lit photos where faces are visible and roughly front-facing give the best results. For two-person photos, both faces should be fully in frame. Good image quality in both inputs leads to a more convincing kissing animation.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I use photos of pets or animated characters?\",\"description\":\"Yes — the AI kiss video generator works with any image containing a recognizable face. Pets, cartoon characters, and illustrated portraits all animate well. The clearer the facial features, the better the output quality.\"},{\"title\":\"What format and length is the output video?\",\"description\":\"The AI kiss video generator outputs a 5-second MP4 clip. This length is optimized for social media and is ready to download and share immediately — no trimming or editing needed.\"},{\"title\":\"How much does it cost to generate a kiss video?\",\"description\":\"Each AI kiss video costs $0.30 in credits. You only pay per generation — no subscription required to get started.\"},{\"title\":\"Does the AI keep the original faces recognizable in the video?\",\"description\":\"Yes. The AI kiss video generator is designed to preserve the likeness of both subjects throughout the animation. Facial features, proportions, and overall appearance remain consistent with the original photos.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Try the AI Kiss Video Generator Now\",\"description\":\"Upload one photo or two portraits and generate a fun animated kissing video in minutes. No prompts, no editing — just upload and go.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Generate Your Kiss Video\",\"url\":\"#video-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\"}]}},\"AIJiggleGeneratorPage\":{\"metadata\":{\