 instantly and share it directly to TikTok, Instagram Reels, or any platform — no post-processing required.\",\"icon\":\"RiVideoLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/jiggle/jiggle-video-3.mp4\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Why Choose Our AI Jiggle Video Generator\",\"description\":\"Simple to use, fast to generate, and built for sharing — here is what sets this jiggle video tool apart.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiSparklingLine\",\"title\":\"Easy to Get Started\",\"description\":\"No software to install, no complex setup. Upload one photo and generate your first jiggle video in minutes — simple from the very first click.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"title\":\"Realistic Jiggle Motion\",\"description\":\"Advanced AI motion modeling produces natural, expressive jiggle effects that look convincing — not stiff or cartoonish. The result feels alive.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTimeLine\",\"title\":\"Fast Video Generation\",\"description\":\"Our optimized AI pipeline delivers your jiggle video quickly. No long waits — just upload, click generate, and your clip is ready in minutes.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShareLine\",\"title\":\"Social Media Ready\",\"description\":\"Output clips are optimized for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and other short-form platforms. Download and post directly — no extra editing needed.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShieldCheckLine\",\"title\":\"Consistent Output Quality\",\"description\":\"Every generated clip maintains clean visual fidelity. The subject's likeness and details are preserved throughout the animation, delivering a polished result every time.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiUserSmileLine\",\"title\":\"Built for Everyone\",\"description\":\"No design experience needed. Whether you are a content creator or just having fun, the interface is intuitive enough for anyone to produce a great jiggle video on the first try.\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Create a Jiggle Video in 3 Simple Steps\",\"description\":\"One photo is all you need. Follow these steps to generate your first AI jiggle video in minutes.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Upload a Clear Front-Facing Photo\",\"description\":\"Choose a single, well-lit photo of one person. Upper body or full body shots work best. Make sure the subject is clearly visible and facing forward for the most expressive jiggle animation.\"},{\"title\":\"AI Analyzes and Animates Your Photo\",\"description\":\"Our AI reads the image, maps the body structure, and generates smooth jiggle motion. The model handles all the heavy lifting — no prompts or manual settings required from you.\"},{\"title\":\"Download and Share Your Video\",\"description\":\"Once generation completes, your jiggle video is ready to download. Share it straight to TikTok, Instagram, or send it in a message — it is optimized for every major social platform.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"What People Create with AI Jiggle Videos\",\"description\":\"From viral clips to everyday laughs — here is how people are putting the AI jiggle video generator to work.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiTiktokLine\",\"title\":\"Social Media Content\",\"description\":\"Generate attention-grabbing jiggle videos for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and Shorts. Short, funny, and endlessly shareable — perfect for building engagement.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiEmotionLaughLine\",\"title\":\"Viral Entertainment\",\"description\":\"Turn unexpected or funny photos into hilarious jiggle clips that friends and followers love to share. The more surprising the subject, the better the reaction.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiPaletteLine\",\"title\":\"Creative Projects\",\"description\":\"Add jiggle animations to video edits, fan content, or digital art projects. The output blends naturally into existing footage and works across creative formats.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGamepadLine\",\"title\":\"Just for Fun\",\"description\":\"Bring everyday photos to life with a touch of playful motion. Animate a portrait of a friend, a selfie, or a favorite character — no special reason needed, just enjoy the result.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGroupLine\",\"title\":\"Gift \u0026 Party Moments\",\"description\":\"Create a personalized jiggle video as a fun gift or party surprise. Animate someone's photo and share it as a birthday message, prank, or memorable keepsake.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiLightbulbLine\",\"title\":\"Bring Your Ideas to Life\",\"description\":\"Have a concept you want to see in motion? Upload any portrait and let AI handle the animation. It is an effortless way to turn a static idea into a lively, shareable video.\"}]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"AI Jiggle Video Generator — FAQ\",\"description\":\"Common questions about how the AI jiggle video generator works.\",\"label\":\"FAQ\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"What is an AI jiggle video generator?\",\"description\":\"An AI jiggle video generator takes a single still photo and animates it into a short video featuring natural, expressive jiggle motion. Our tool uses advanced machine learning to analyze the image and produce smooth, entertaining movement without any manual input.\"},{\"title\":\"What types of photos produce the best jiggle videos?\",\"description\":\"Clear, front-facing photos with good lighting give the best results. Upper body or full body shots work better than close-up portraits. Make sure the subject is fully visible and centered in the frame. Single-person photos of women are most suitable for this effect.\"},{\"title\":\"Are there any limitations I should know about?\",\"description\":\"The jiggle effect focuses on natural body movement. In some cases, the motion may appear more like a swaying or hip movement rather than a pronounced jiggle — this depends on the pose and image composition. For the most consistent results, use front-facing upper body or full body photos.\"},{\"title\":\"How much does it cost to generate a jiggle video?\",\"description\":\"Each jiggle video generation uses a small amount of credits. New users receive starter credits upon sign-up — no subscription required to get going.\"},{\"title\":\"How long does it take to generate a jiggle video?\",\"description\":\"Most jiggle videos are ready within a few minutes. Generation time depends on server load, but you will be notified as soon as your clip is complete. There is no need to keep the page open while waiting.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Start Creating Jiggle Videos with AI Today\",\"description\":\"Upload one photo and generate a fun, shareable jiggle video in minutes. No editing skills required — just upload and go.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Start Creating\",\"url\":\"#video-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\"}]}},\"AITwerkGeneratorPage\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"AI Twerk Generator - Make Your Photos Dance\",\"description\":\"Turn any portrait into a twerking dance video with hip-hop music. Upload a photo and generate entertaining content instantly.\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"AI Twerk Generator — Turn Portraits Into Dance Videos\",\"description\":\"Upload a single portrait and watch our AI animate it into a lively twerking dance video with synchronized hip-hop music. No prompts, no settings — just upload and generate.\"},\"demo\":{\"title\":\"From Portrait to Dancing Video\",\"description\":\"Upload one clear photo and our AI generates a twerking video complete with upbeat background music — no editing required.\",\"inputLabel\":\"Input Photo\",\"outputLabel\":\"AI Generated Dance Video\",\"examples\":[{\"inputImages\":[\"/videos/twerk/twerk-demo-image.jpeg\"],\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/twerk/twerk-demo.mp4\"}]},\"feature\":{\"title\":\"What Sets Our AI Twerk Generator Apart\",\"description\":\"Smooth dance animation, built-in music, and effortless output — here is what powers every twerking video.\",\"features\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"title\":\"One-Click Dance Animation\",\"description\":\"No prompts or complex settings required. Upload your portrait and click generate — the AI handles motion planning, body animation, and video rendering automatically.\",\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/twerk/twerk-1.mp4\"},{\"id\":\"2\",\"title\":\"Built-In Hip-Hop Music\",\"description\":\"Every generated video includes synchronized upbeat background music for a complete, share-ready experience — no separate audio editing needed.\",\"icon\":\"RiMusic2Line\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/twerk/twerk-2.mp4\"},{\"id\":\"3\",\"title\":\"Social-Ready Output\",\"description\":\"Download your finished twerking video and share it directly on TikTok, Instagram Reels, or Stories. The output is optimized for short-form social formats.\",\"icon\":\"RiShareLine\",\"videoUrl\":\"/videos/twerk/twerk-demo.mp4\"}]},\"benefits\":{\"title\":\"Why Use Our AI Twerk Generator\",\"description\":\"Simple input, automatic music, and instant output — here is what makes this twerk video generator different.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUserLine\",\"title\":\"Portrait Friendly\",\"description\":\"Optimized for clear, front-facing portrait and upper-body shots. Works best when the subject is well-lit and in focus.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMusic2Line\",\"title\":\"Automatic Music Sync\",\"description\":\"Hip-hop background music is added automatically to every video — no audio editing or separate uploads required.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTimeLine\",\"title\":\"Fast Processing\",\"description\":\"Your dancing video is generated and ready to download in minutes. No long waits or complicated rendering steps.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiDownloadLine\",\"title\":\"Easy to Share\",\"description\":\"Download your twerking video and post it anywhere — TikTok, Reels, Stories, or send it directly in a message.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiSmartphoneLine\",\"title\":\"No App Required\",\"description\":\"Works directly in your browser on any device — no software to install, no account setup needed to get started.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiShieldCheckLine\",\"title\":\"Safe and Private\",\"description\":\"Your uploaded photos are used only to generate your video and are never shared or stored beyond processing.\"}]},\"usage\":{\"badge\":\"How It Works\",\"title\":\"Generate a Twerking Video in 3 Steps\",\"description\":\"One photo is all it takes. Upload, generate, and share your dancing video in minutes.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Upload Your Photo\",\"description\":\"Provide a clear portrait or upper-body shot. Front-facing images with good lighting produce the best dance animation results.\"},{\"title\":\"Generate\",\"description\":\"Click the generate button and let the AI process your image. The model animates the body, plans the dance motion, and adds music automatically.\"},{\"title\":\"Download and Share\",\"description\":\"Your twerking video is ready. Download it and share on TikTok, Instagram Reels, Stories, or anywhere else you want.\"}]},\"use-cases\":{\"title\":\"What People Create with AI Twerk Generator\",\"description\":\"From social media content to party entertainment — here is how people use this twerk video generator.\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"RiUser3Line\",\"title\":\"Just for You\",\"description\":\"Want to see yourself or a friend dance? Upload any photo and generate a fun twerking video for your own entertainment — no reason needed.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiTiktokLine\",\"title\":\"Social Media Content\",\"description\":\"Create short, engaging dance clips for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and Stories. Fun content that naturally drives shares and engagement.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGroupLine\",\"title\":\"Party and Events\",\"description\":\"Generate hilarious twerking videos of friends and family to entertain guests at birthdays, reunions, and celebrations.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiMegaphoneLine\",\"title\":\"Viral Marketing\",\"description\":\"Produce eye-catching promotional videos that stand out in social feeds. Animated content consistently outperforms static images for reach.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiEmotionLaughLine\",\"title\":\"Memes and Fun\",\"description\":\"Turn any portrait into an entertaining dance video for memes, reactions, or just a laugh with friends.\"},{\"icon\":\"RiGiftLine\",\"title\":\"Surprise Gifts\",\"description\":\"Create a personalized dancing video as a unique gift for birthdays or special occasions — something they will never forget.\"}]},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"AI Twerk Generator — Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Everything you need to know about generating twerking dance videos from photos.\",\"label\":\"FAQ\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"What is the AI Twerk Generator?\",\"description\":\"The AI Twerk Generator uses artificial intelligence to animate a portrait photo into a twerking dance video with synchronized hip-hop background music. Upload one image and receive a complete dancing video.\"},{\"title\":\"What kind of photos work best?\",\"description\":\"Clear, front-facing portrait or upper-body shots with good lighting produce the best results. Make sure the subject is well-lit, in focus, and reasonably centered in the frame.\"},{\"title\":\"Do I need to write a prompt or adjust settings?\",\"description\":\"No. Just upload your image and click generate — no text prompts, no style pickers, no configuration required. The AI handles everything automatically.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I share the generated video?\",\"description\":\"Yes. Once generated, you can download the video and share it on any platform — TikTok, Instagram, messaging apps, or wherever you like.\"},{\"title\":\"How many credits does it cost?\",\"description\":\"Each twerking video generation costs 6 credits. Credits can be purchased through the pricing page.\"}]},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Ready to Make Your Photo Dance?\",\"description\":\"Upload a portrait and generate your twerking video in minutes — no prompts, no editing required.\",\"buttons\":[{\"title\":\"Generate Now\",\"url\":\"#video-generator\",\"target\":\"_self\"}]}},\"audoraAd\":{\"brand\":\"Audora\",\"eyebrow\":\"Create with Audora\",\"headline\":\"Make a Song with Your Own Voice\",\"description\":\"Record your voice. AI turns it into an original song.\",\"button\":\"Create My Song\",\"closeLabel\":\"Close Audora promotion\",\"floatingLabel\":\"Aud